# POST /reload (contract C7 in docs/source/contracts.md).
# Open in VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client, or use the curl lines.

### Reload the served model
# curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/reload -H "X-Reload-Token: $RELOAD_TOKEN"
POST http://localhost:8000/reload
X-Reload-Token: {{reload_token}}

### 200: a new version is served
# {
#   "previous_version": "logistic_regression-20261109081500",
#   "current_version": "champion-20261116090000",
#   "changed": true,
#   "reloaded_at": "2026-11-16T09:00:05.123456Z"
# }

### 503: reload failed, the previous model is still served
# {"detail": "Reload failed, previous model kept. models/model.joblib not found. Run `uv run invoke sample-model` first."}

### Check the served version afterwards
GET http://localhost:8000/health
